    "abstract": "Parts figure for the transformer rectifier unit installation showing the output bus bar group, the contactor and relay set and the terminal hardware, split across two sheets for the left and right installations.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the transformer rectifier unit installation, including the output bus bar, the relay and contactor group and the terminal hardware, and states which of them may only be ordered together.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left-hand installation looking outboard; sheet 2 shows the right-hand installation, which is a mirror image except for the ground stud position. The bus bar and the relay assembly carry pre and post modification effectivity and must be ordered as a set: a machined bus bar with the tin-plated relay assembly is not an approved configuration. CAUTION: DO NOT ORDER ITEM 10 WITHOUT ITEM 20 OR ITEM 20 WITHOUT ITEM 10. THE TWO ITEMS TOGETHER MAKE THE POST-MODIFICATION STANDARD AND NEITHER IS RELEASED ON ITS OWN. Item 30 is supplied in packs of ten. The Belleville stacks at item 40 are not separately procurable and come with the bus bar."
    },
